# QA M5 regression (D-076, D-086; was qa_m5_bug_shrink_while_floating_sinks,
# fixed in E32): a hurt while floating at the surface as Zuckerschock used
# to drop Normal Resi out of the surface band, so she sank without DOWN.
# Resi bumps the start M-box (col 9) and catches the Mozartkugel (big at
# 159), hops the bollard and the notch onto the Dampfer, rides it to
# Gschwendt, walks off the pier's far end and floats at the surface with
# no input: big, top 184 = chest point 192 exactly on the water line.
# Swan #2 charges into her: Hurt at 1612 (with D-087's zone; 1756 before),
# Zuckerschock -> Normal. Before E32 the shrink kept the feet, so the
# chest point landed at surface + 8, outside the surface band, and she
# sank to the lake bed after the 30-frame freeze (and a JUMP press stroked
# instead of jumping out). Since E32 a power change while swimming keeps
# the top, and so the chest point: she still floats at the surface (top
# <= 191) with no input to the end (frame 1830).
